#Introduction to paper

This is the R script used to make the visuals for the orginal research article 'Multidrug Resistance in Bacteria Associated with Leafy Greens and Soil in Urban Agriculture Systems'

#Libraries
```{r}
library(tidyverse)
library(data.table)
library(RColorBrewer) 
library(ComplexHeatmap)
library(circlize)
library(plotly)
```

